OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F416A1784299697
OL,3,CUlster players named in Ireland Six
OL,4,CNations team for match in Paris
OL,6,FAndy Farrell has named his team for
OL,7,Fthe opening Six Nations game of the
OL,8,Fchampionship when France host Ireland
OL,9,Fin the Stade de France on Thursday
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,12,FTwo Ulster players have made the
OL,13,Fstarting 15. Jacob Stockdale is on the
OL,14,Fwing and Stuart McCloskey is in the
OL,15,Fcentre alongside Garry Ringrose. Jamie
OL,16,FOsborne has been named at full back
OL,17,Fand Sam Predergast gets the no. 10
OL,18,Fjersey. Ulster's Nick Timoney is on
OL,19,Fthe bench.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
