OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F416A1784299697
OL,3,CUlster players named in Ireland Six
OL,4,CNations team for match in Paris
OL,6,FSign up for our free weekly newsletter
OL,7,Fhere.
OL,9,FCaelan Doris will lead the side
OL,11,FJamie Osborne, Tommy O'Brien join
OL,12,FStockdale in the Ireland back three,
OL,13,Fwith McCloskey partnering Garry
OL,14,FRingrose in midfield, while Jamison
OL,15,FGibson-Park and Sam Prendergast are
OL,16,Fnamed in the half-backs.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
