SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F416A1784299697
OL,3,CUlster players named in Ireland Six
OL,4,CNations team for match in Paris
OL,6,FIn the pack, Jeremy Loughman, Dan
OL,7,FSheehanand Thomas Clarkson are in the
OL,8,Ffront row, with Joe McCarthy and Tadhg
OL,9,FBeirne in the engine room and Cian
OL,10,FPrendergast, Josh van der Flierand
OL,11,Fcaptain Doris in the back row.
OL,13,FFarrell has strong options available
OL,14,Fon the bench with Ronan Kelleher,
OL,15,FMichael Milne, Finlay Bealham, James
OL,16,FRyan, Jack Conan and Nick Timoney the
OL,17,Fforward replacements, with backs Craig
OL,18,FCasey and Jack Crowley completing
OL,19,FIreland's Match Day 23.
OL,26,@vD@Trw
