OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F416A1784299697
OL,3,CUlster players named in Ireland Six
OL,4,CNations team for match in Paris
OL,6,FAndy Farrell said: "I've been pleased
OL,7,Fwith the application of the squad
OL,8,Fsince we linked up last week and we've
OL,9,Fa good body of work under our belts
OL,10,Ffrom our training camp in Portugal as
OL,11,Fwe face into an exciting test match
OL,12,Fagainst France. The Six Nations is an
OL,13,Famazing tournament to compete in and
OL,14,Fit brings out the best in players.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
