PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F416A1784299697
OL,3,CUlster players named in Ireland Six
OL,4,CNations team for match in Paris
OL,6,F"We have played at the Stade de France
OL,7,Fmany times and it's a terrific stadium
OL,8,Fwith an incredible atmosphere. We know
OL,9,Ffrom our experiences on the road how
OL,10,Fproud and vocal the travelling Irish
OL,11,Fsupport can be and it's a huge
OL,12,Fmotivator for the squad knowing that
OL,13,Fwe have so many Irish supporters
OL,14,Fbehind us."
OL,16,FThursday's match is live on ITV from
OL,17,F7pm for 7.20pm kick off.
OL,19,FIreland (v France):
OL,21,F15. Jamie Osborne (Naas/Leinster)(10)
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
